                  <nc xml:id="m-8c8bccd6-5682-4931-883f-45ca03934acd" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-83a5cf84-eb15-42ef-9fb8-6d4239e53665">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-5adf0a95-62dd-40d5-a52b-c615066b6b01" type="punctum" xml:id="m-0c99b129-4d0f-44b2-b710-fd4a19455f1a">
                  <nc xml:id="m-ad0e08a3-a83e-487b-a252-b8815fcb6f1b" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-9b42801c-48da-4ca4-ac1c-9e9e23435cfa" facs="#m-805177c2-25a9-436e-b791-03a8362a8859" form="maxima" /><syllable xml:id="m-5d62112a-1663-4373-8ef4-98afa24f1614">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e285b9f1-0bcb-4aba-94f9-a01587868208" type="punctum" xml:id="m-34d85a25-50c4-4cd1-9a12-a30a49eaa2cc">
                  <nc xml:id="m-f19f2c7c-c4de-47fd-a18e-6db8767d0203" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-d9dafc19-45c7-4431-8616-5acf1a823e7d">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-2d69256e-47a7-4b57-a440-2918184475c8" type="punctum" xml:id="m-fdf4f30a-b863-498a-bc76-678e8b655360">
                  <nc xml:id="m-6eabdb9d-4e45-43a5-aa57-e6292bfbe408" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-ef23c501-1d92-4cd0-953c-c3761ec8a86e">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-dc32d229-8bc8-43b9-8f0d-fab6bd0285c2" type="punctum" xml:id="m-623a3215-fcf4-4fd3-b6d5-76d2bfaf4e22">
                  <nc xml:id="m-416bf852-a821-45e2-9a42-6db9995b9948" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-1ad06951-350a-4918-bba4-9d40d15f72cb">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-c7798cb0-b110-4c11-93ee-b263dedc245f" type="punctum" xml:id="m-9e0f79ef-86f2-42bc-8d23-42f9c062e392">
                  <nc xml:id="m-b94b6999-6f1e-4419-8344-b051516099a8" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-c3f08d19-d801-4993-a47e-b27da5acf64f"><syl /><neume facs="#m-cab52488-fe04-45a3-97ef-7840b2bec0c0" type="punctum" xml:id="m-76f36a5e-fc02-4d08-b452-ae64fe16cd16"><nc xml:id="m-34fa404b-5df8-4309-8b53-ad25b00911f4" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-fd5d59c8-91c5-4d8d-aca5-328a2008c2ec">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e32e99b3-01f1-432a-b81a-1ac531f98306" type="punctum" xml:id="m-f5a4422c-e3b6-4485-b105-e28cdf838dbc">
                  <nc xml:id="m-9427dfb5-4572-486c-b4ed-060a2249b2c8" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-cc335a88-bd36-47d4-a797-bec7b802d8cd">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-6b18f753-8ebc-419a-ad16-d0051cee17dd" type="punctum" xml:id="m-8b9cc914-36ab-4798-b4da-24ed1615a911">
                  <nc xml:id="m-48727d5c-077f-4115-9167-5d9de30c8a3c" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-0048443a-e7a9-4ce0-bb8c-4954040201b3">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-d409921a-fd5d-4880-af39-439dc334f47f" type="podatus" xml:id="m-24c1cb81-9722-4c05-b7b5-d6834cd490cf">
                  <nc xml:id="m-24dea9eb-c29b-43ba-a9ab-c0bf20a6182b" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-2cc03626-2441-439a-8e21-175c05cae931" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-c76a7c1d-f505-4d58-97f8-86dff6fe938e"><syl /><neume facs="#m-f4fda411-3204-4c2d-b1f5-6647fc85ef7d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-d262d672-3a46-4035-9105-90deda055723"><nc xml:id="m-65ad2c2b-0aef-49b8-b9e7-57843071f9c8" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-9ec39044-89f9-47c8-b524-801ab078a649" facs="#m-2c65768c-0733-40f4-95de-d898360ae80d" form="finalis" /><syllable xml:id="m-f78883f8-67d4-4a3e-9d9d-f043079d20f0">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-081c41ef-d38f-413b-9742-83f872354fc8" type="punctum" xml:id="m-71aca3df-d88b-4b46-b967-7d9e07671a12">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1d19a5a7-91e6-4755-bbac-d22b526cbe19" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-b3588b64-d4f4-4e1c-bd91-98e33bd462a4" /></nc></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-ba4a6b81-179f-4ceb-a28c-926cf9f4cf93"><lg xml:id="m-d328a965-a680-4a11-8466-58717fea2211"><l xml:id="m-cab84428-cb99-4b2f-b354-3f7ef75a5186" facs="#m-6063fae1-4a50-4d76-82c7-b21bcab71ae8" label="ambiguous">872</l><l xml:id="m-8366e15b-1c8e-4759-ab19-ef061acfda4a" facs="#m-6dfbd987-d112-4374-b5c2-77d2afd2b656" label="text-like">Canticle of the Blessed Virgin</l><l xml:id="m-d353727a-4964-4604-a757-4f6a99c2a249" facs="#m-6cfde843-0e7e-424e-82af-66e453676adb" label="lyrics-like">11. Custódi me a láqueo, quem posuérunt mihi, *eta tendiculis</l><l xml:id="m-fef1ed58-ff71-4f3a-bb78-b2b230e0322a" facs="#m-a7006c8c-277c-423d-bc23-628b7cd556ac" label="lyrics-like">agéntium iniqua.</l><l xml:id="m-b681c34f-a326-4732-a231-a3ca9fa4a9f7" facs="#m-999584bb-c23d-490f-ae92-0b6cf1373e57" label="lyrics-like">12. Cádant in rétia súa impii simul, * dum égo sálvus evádam.</l><l xml:id="m-52ae6a5e-5baa-4622-ac26-8b4d35f8682e" facs="#m-958c4666-d6b9-4086-b6b8-9432f58e4daa" label="ambiguous">Psalm 141</l><l xml:id="m-d32fc9b8-7940-4f73-bf74-601e3887f7d9" facs="#m-b0e1f1cb-b50f-4bfe-894e-99e59ac863c9" label="lyrics-like">1.Vó-ce mágna ad Dóminum clá-mo, r vóce mágna Dóminum óbsecro.</l><l xml:id="m-42446bb1-0a02-43b8-8718-6f5019b22017" facs="#m-db9bfa83-c769-47b6-8c3b-a5bd333daa4e" label="lyrics-like">Flex: Dómine; t</l><l xml:id="m-598bd8a9-2333-47c5-becc-c5ee7e320d8b" facs="#m-7995955e-b5f5-4a24-af81-b3a0e513b8b1" label="lyrics-like">2. Effúndo coram éo sollicitúdinem méam, * angústiam méam coram</l><l xml:id="m-c67abbf9-3ace-4327-807e-130bc30a35c1" facs="#m-5726ec1f-5b74-4cd3-bba8-364540071adc" label="lyrics-like">ipso pándo.</l><l xml:id="m-b2bb7807-6004-4209-8012-19aa1ad225fe" facs="#m-15e5ea74-0013-4ab4-b142-7bed448166fc" label="lyrics-like">3. Cum anxiátur in me spíritus méus, * tu novísti viam méam.</l><l xml:id="m-7329da26-e03b-4391-ba98-2ec56f14d32c" facs="#m-2abdde34-c621-4c9d-a13f-e260e4438718" label="lyrics-like">4. In vía qua incédo, * abscondérunt láqueum mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-dfebc5bd-fd88-4f59-8e3f-0ee297f46a70" facs="#m-dd4051f1-ff8b-4043-a530-89f9ebde3b46" label="lyrics-like">5. Respício ad déxtram et video, * et non est, qui de me cúret.</l><l xml:id="m-4309460f-c2a4-45ca-806f-fadd931ed144" facs="#m-ccb421ae-e9be-4ad5-bca3-4eae67ec50cd" label="lyrics-like">6. Non est, quo fúgiam, * non est, qui prospíciat vitae méae.—</l><l xml:id="m-a1593b98-5200-46c1-805b-bb9e867ffa38" facs="#m-17f9119d-99dd-4abb-bfd6-03f1e0bfc405" label="lyrics-like">7. Clámo ad te, Dómine; t dico: Tu es refúgium méum, * pórtio</l><l xml:id="m-7172ff7f-75d8-4747-b825-8de3bbe34594" facs="#m-cdfbf9d1-aa18-43cf-8244-c0a272faf110" label="lyrics-like">méa in térra vivéntium.</l><l xml:id="m-3ab95a2e-291a-46e0-9120-ec2c0a32cdb9" facs="#m-82f2ba59-a38c-4e96-a5a0-7836a78dfdca" label="lyrics-like">8. Atténde ad clamórem méum, * quia miser fáctus sum válde.</l><l xml:id="m-024aabd8-af9b-4905-8eb1-9814d11b7f18" facs="#m-7b154dd6-dfda-479a-bf7d-132f7d0e7e39" label="lyrics-like">9. Eripe me a persequéntibus me, *quia me fortióres sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-57309408-5c1e-46e9-82e7-68d04f90d7e1" facs="#m-07602101-1022-472d-bc85-4afe49f17205" label="lyrics-like">10. De cárcere éduc me, * ut grátias ágam nómini túo.</l><l xml:id="m-7def7be1-ae1c-4bdc-948a-639e602f3ba4" facs="#m-a5ced8b0-d5f4-4865-8017-18d0d175ab89" label="lyrics-like">11. Justi circúmdabunt me, * cum bene féceris mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-c04f327d-0ae8-420f-83a6-c992bb77b8a5" facs="#m-5181a8db-9025-4ea2-8e0e-34ac78244446" label="ambiguous">Luke, 1, 46-55</l><l xml:id="m-d89cd8ec-8337-4f22-a899-6a65cf8e2138" facs="#m-29e83e0b-d474-41dc-a6be-42e48917e551" label="text-like">Canticle of the Blessed Virgin</l><l xml:id="m-6d9c2e9c-5fdf-431c-8d34-ab74095c84e6" facs="#m-4d3602d2-dd9f-4f3e-8725-249bb0343f17" label="lyrics-like">1. Magni-fi-cat* ánima mé-a Dóminum;</l><l xml:id="m-3267a1e1-438f-4aa7-9129-aa20fddf7623" facs="#m-e6c57dee-bcc9-41e9-8bfc-17262860a586" label="lyrics-like">2. Et exsultávit spi-ri-tus mé¬ us* in Dé-o salva-tó-re mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5876a9bc-19b3-4099-ae6d-da1b3ac9cd0f" facs="#m-fab5db46-27e4-4641-a271-3acb36c2818e" label="lyrics-like">3. Quia respéxit humilitátem ancillae súae: * ecce enim ex hoc beátam</l><l xml:id="m-1f11005e-4325-434e-a2b4-7b5dad3c4125" facs="#m-3be3b6a3-d8c8-4569-b496-5347d34dbbe6" label="lyrics-like">me dicent ómnes generatiónes,</l><l xml:id="m-44637a91-36fb-4e80-b031-0f6e96e74b70" facs="#m-cdd71f58-a97c-49d0-af25-0f1febe1d8be" label="lyrics-like">4. Quia fécit mihi mágna qui pótens est, *et sánctum nómen éjus,</l><l xml:id="m-9ca38d2d-14f2-4663-b655-dd9179b7c7bc" facs="#m-37dd98a9-656e-448e-b3ef-c9a6d01f3c91" label="lyrics-like">5. Et misericórdia éjus a progénie in progénies * timéntibus éum. —</l><l xml:id="m-4ab78734-db0b-407d-8bb8-6001da5e1bfa" facs="#m-79c14ab6-1047-4516-a95e-24d61e0fa4eb" label="lyrics-like">6. Fécit poténtiam bráchio súo; * dispérsit supérbos ménte córdis</l><l xml:id="m-19aa08a9-9e3a-4113-9e78-c670fd42e665" facs="#m-de3aff09-e701-45c7-9eba-f6109e159326" label="lyrics-like">súi.</l><l xml:id="m-ea044430-cf3f-49be-ad52-271c03d4c0b8" facs="#m-6511d2a0-c8d6-4f56-a9c3-a9ebd5bec04b" label="lyrics-like">7. Depósuit poténtes de séde, * et exaltávit húmiles.</l><l xml:id="m-698b2cf7-236b-4d2f-aa4e-8421178fabb0" facs="#m-72f618cc-8cfa-4ce1-a6e6-615636034704" label="lyrics-like">8. Esuriéntes implévit bónis, * et divites dimísit inánes.—</l><l xml:id="m-c36fc3d3-2cc4-4a32-b597-a3961a0b4b4d" facs="#m-c70f9a4d-f1a2-4512-a4ce-a82bb57ec0d2" label="lyrics-like">9. Suscépit Israël, sérvum súum, * recordátus misericórdide súae,</l><l xml:id="m-822b8a22-0518-4c13-9bf3-88c5b3f31c45" facs="#m-f607e687-9725-462b-bd82-c1d49c57728f" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut locútus est ad pâtres nóstros, * erga Abraham et sémen</l><l xml:id="m-bea86fe0-0614-4f91-8955-1892698e1416" facs="#m-9f853875-0a13-4405-bffa-33de06eccf41" label="lyrics-like">éjus in saécula.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>